WEBVTT

00:10.990 --> 00:12.240
<b>They're selling candy!</b>

00:12.530 --> 00:13.450
<b>Let's buy some!</b>

00:13.950 --> 00:15.160
<b>I want some candy!</b>

01:50.000 --> 01:54.000
<b>EPISODE 10:
A REASON TO ACT</b>

01:56.840 --> 01:59.430
<b>How many years has it been
since I last made some ohagi?</b>

02:00.510 --> 02:01.350
<b>My.</b>

02:03.760 --> 02:06.060
<b>My, my, my.</b>

02:05.140 --> 02:06.770
<b>This is tasty, that it is.</b>

02:06.770 --> 02:07.730
<b>Thanks.</b>

02:08.230 --> 02:11.440
<b>But anyone can make a tasty ohagi.</b>

02:11.650 --> 02:14.690
<b>Oh, no. Last time Miss Kaoru made some,</b>

02:14.690 --> 02:16.030
<b>it was like balls of mud—</b>

02:17.280 --> 02:18.110
<b>Oro...</b>

02:18.110 --> 02:20.280
<b>Don't say things you don't need to say.</b>

02:20.280 --> 02:23.240
<b>You really are
a troublesome, violent girl.</b>

02:24.160 --> 02:25.580
<b>- Ororo.
- So how about it?</b>

02:25.580 --> 02:27.710
<b>You can leave her and see me instead.</b>

02:28.330 --> 02:31.500
<b>Miss Megumi!</b>

02:34.210 --> 02:37.050
<b>I let my guard down a little bit,
and you press your luck!</b>

02:37.050 --> 02:40.180
<b>I thought I told you that I'd kick you out
if you made moves on Kenshin!</b>

02:40.180 --> 02:43.140
<b>Oh? Love and romance
is up to each individual.</b>

02:44.260 --> 02:47.180
<b>How you nitpick
each and every time like that</b>

02:47.180 --> 02:49.690
<b>is proof you're
not confident in yourself, isn't it?</b>

02:50.810 --> 02:54.980
<b>If you're frustrated, why don't you
become able to make tasty ohagi?</b>

02:55.860 --> 02:57.190
<b>I can't talk back.</b>

02:59.070 --> 03:01.360
<b>I thought she'd end up
slightly more graceful,</b>

03:01.360 --> 03:03.530
<b>but she hasn't changed a bit.</b>

03:03.990 --> 03:08.370
<b>But she's a lot brighter and lively
compared to before, that she is.</b>

03:08.870 --> 03:10.250
<b>That's a good thing, that it is.</b>

03:10.660 --> 03:11.710
<b>It's not good!</b>

03:11.710 --> 03:14.840
<b>What is this farce
so early in the morning?</b>

03:14.840 --> 03:16.250
<b>Oh, Sano.</b>

03:16.250 --> 03:18.460
<b>The old man's got the results.</b>

03:18.460 --> 03:22.470
<b>Without a doubt, this is the new opium
that is the talk of the town.</b>

03:23.510 --> 03:24.930
<b>I see, so it is.</b>

03:27.180 --> 03:29.730
<b>You haven't had breakfast yet, have you?
You want some?</b>

03:29.730 --> 03:30.850
<b>Don't want any.</b>

03:31.310 --> 03:34.480
<b>I don't wanna eat anything
made by opium girl,</b>

03:34.480 --> 03:36.480
<b>even more so than anything made by missie.</b>

03:36.480 --> 03:37.320
<b>Wha—</b>

03:40.440 --> 03:42.570
<b>I've been up all night.</b>

03:42.570 --> 03:45.740
<b>I'm gonna borrow a bedroom,
so wake me up when the noon-gun goes off.</b>

03:45.740 --> 03:49.830
<b>Hold it just a second!
I can't let that last line pass!</b>

03:50.040 --> 03:51.210
<b>There, there.</b>

03:52.410 --> 03:54.830
<b>Don't let that get to you either,
Miss Megumi.</b>

03:56.460 --> 03:59.800
<b>We figured out that Miss Megumi
was the creator of the opium,</b>

03:59.800 --> 04:02.510
<b>but at the same time,
we learned of your past,</b>

04:02.510 --> 04:05.220
<b>making us unable to pin the blame on you
even if we wanted to.</b>

04:06.300 --> 04:10.680
<b>On top of that, Kanryu's group hasn't made
any moves whatsoever for a week since.</b>

04:11.980 --> 04:15.900
<b>He lost sight of what to do
with the fist he raised.</b>

04:16.610 --> 04:19.110
<b>That's probably what's behind
his irritation, that it is.</b>

04:20.480 --> 04:22.820
<b>Let's leave him be for a while,
that we should.</b>

04:27.030 --> 04:29.370
<b>"Opium girl," huh?</b>

04:30.790 --> 04:32.040
<b>Hello!</b>

04:32.450 --> 04:36.170
<b>Thanks for your continued patronage.
I'm the book lender.</b>

04:36.420 --> 04:39.800
<b>I have quite a few new books.
How about it?</b>

04:39.800 --> 04:40.630
<b>I see.</b>

04:41.260 --> 04:44.760
<b>Miss, I see you often lately.</b>

04:44.760 --> 04:47.140
<b>Are you going to be a new resident here?</b>

04:47.140 --> 04:49.720
<b>No, I'm just a freeloader.</b>

04:50.220 --> 04:51.810
<b>So I see.</b>

04:52.560 --> 04:54.270
<b>That's good.</b>

04:55.850 --> 04:57.270
<b>Now quiet.</b>

04:57.270 --> 05:00.690
<b>If you make a ruckus,
I'll pour this into that well.</b>

05:00.900 --> 05:02.070
<b>Mercury!</b>

05:02.230 --> 05:05.280
<b>Kanryu Takeda wishes to speak to you.</b>

05:05.780 --> 05:08.450
<b>Can you make an effort to come by?</b>

05:14.080 --> 05:15.540
<b>What do you want to talk about?</b>

05:17.250 --> 05:19.540
<b>That goes without saying, doesn't it?</b>

05:20.040 --> 05:22.920
<b>Why don't you just hurry up
and come back to us?</b>

05:23.460 --> 05:26.680
<b>I'd rather die than go back to your place.</b>

05:26.880 --> 05:30.800
<b>I see. If you're not coming back...</b>

05:31.720 --> 05:34.390
<b>we will burn Kamiya Dojo down.</b>

05:35.480 --> 05:40.230
<b>My private army, the Oniwaban Group,
and the neighborhood yakuza,</b>

05:40.230 --> 05:46.030
<b>all 500 of us will surround the place
so that not one mouse can escape.</b>

05:46.030 --> 05:47.740
<b>Then we will launch fire arrows.</b>

05:48.240 --> 05:50.870
<b>"If the small cuckoo
refuses to shed a tear,</b>

05:50.870 --> 05:51.950
<b>just kill it right off."</b>

05:55.200 --> 05:58.460
<b>Why don't you give up
on having dreams already?</b>

05:59.000 --> 06:03.340
<b>It is an unavoidable fact
that you refined opium.</b>

06:03.840 --> 06:06.260
<b>Even if you could meet your family,</b>

06:06.260 --> 06:11.140
<b>what would happen if people found out
a Takani girl did such a thing?</b>

06:11.680 --> 06:14.720
<b>It's too late for you to run now.</b>

06:15.220 --> 06:19.600
<b>You, me, and opium all share one fate...</b>

06:20.150 --> 06:22.150
<b>now and forever.</b>

06:23.480 --> 06:24.940
<b>Oh, that's right.</b>

06:24.940 --> 06:27.110
<b>The place will burn tonight at midnight.</b>

06:27.110 --> 06:31.280
<b>There isn't much time 'til then,
so please gather your thoughts by then.</b>

06:31.280 --> 06:32.320
<b>See you.</b>

06:36.330 --> 06:37.620
<b>You think she'll come back...</b>

06:37.910 --> 06:39.040
<b>that woman?</b>

06:39.580 --> 06:42.080
<b>I'd be troubled if she didn't.</b>

06:42.420 --> 06:45.300
<b>Now that we have learned that the one
with the cross-shaped scar</b>

06:45.300 --> 06:47.880
<b>is the legendary manslayer
Himura Battosai,</b>

06:47.880 --> 06:53.550
<b>it is best to not use brute-force tactics
that would bring down his wrath on us.</b>

06:53.890 --> 06:57.180
<b>"Megumi Takani left of her own free will."</b>

06:57.560 --> 07:01.900
<b>And if that's the case, there's no reason
whatsoever for Battosai to make a move.</b>

07:03.230 --> 07:05.320
<b>A reason, huh?</b>

07:08.360 --> 07:09.740
<b><i>I can't escape.</i></b>

07:10.530 --> 07:13.490
<b><i>Not from Kanryu. Not from opium.</i></b>

07:14.370 --> 07:16.040
<b><i>Not for the rest of my life.</i></b>

07:18.950 --> 07:20.580
<b>"Opium girl."</b>

07:24.750 --> 07:25.880
<b><i>Greetings.</i></b>

07:26.170 --> 07:30.090
<b><i>Please forgive me
for leaving quietly of my own accord.</i></b>

07:30.930 --> 07:33.510
<b><i>It seems Kanryu's pursuers
have stopped coming,</i></b>

07:33.510 --> 07:36.430
<b><i>so I will start heading back to Aizu.</i></b>

07:36.970 --> 07:40.980
<b><i>It was only for about ten days, but I
really thank you so much for your help.</i></b>

07:41.640 --> 07:44.610
<b>"Sincerely, Megumi Takani."</b>

07:45.400 --> 07:48.070
<b>Well, this is kind of a letdown.</b>

07:49.940 --> 07:50.990
<b>I screwed up!</b>

07:51.360 --> 07:52.450
<b>Kenshin?</b>

07:52.660 --> 07:56.410
<b>There shouldn't be anyone who is waiting
for Miss Megumi back in Aizu now!</b>

07:57.700 --> 08:00.750
<b>There's no doubt that one of Kanryu's men
contacted and threatened her!</b>

08:01.120 --> 08:04.420
<b>Sano, you know where Kanryu's mansion is,
don't you? Let's go!</b>

08:04.880 --> 08:05.750
<b>You go on ahead.</b>

08:06.630 --> 08:11.090
<b>Why do I have to do anything
for that opium girl?</b>

08:11.220 --> 08:14.760
<b>Sanosuke? Since when do you say such lame—</b>

08:15.470 --> 08:17.350
<b>That's enough, Sano.</b>

08:18.100 --> 08:19.680
<b>This isn't like you.</b>

08:25.350 --> 08:28.570
<b>My buddy was a candy seller.</b>

08:29.320 --> 08:33.740
<b>He loved gambling and the smiles
of kids who came to buy his candy.</b>

08:33.740 --> 08:35.610
<b>Good-natured, but a good-for-nothing.</b>

08:36.120 --> 08:40.160
<b>But then...
he died because of the opium she made.</b>

08:41.120 --> 08:45.000
<b>Where in that story
is there a reason for me to act?</b>

08:45.420 --> 08:49.710
<b>I'm not as much of a sucker as you are,
nor am I a rurouni!</b>

08:55.430 --> 09:00.600
<b>Sano, you didn't look closely
at Miss Megumi's eyes, that you didn't.</b>

09:00.810 --> 09:01.770
<b>Eyes?</b>

09:02.350 --> 09:05.480
<b>She may have acted tough,
but there was a moment</b>

09:05.480 --> 09:07.940
<b>when she looked at us
with lonesome eyes, that there was.</b>

09:09.440 --> 09:10.440
<b>You're...</b>

09:11.400 --> 09:16.660
<b>Go tell Kanryu that Megumi Takani
has returned right now.</b>

09:17.570 --> 09:19.530
<b>Those were eyes looking for friends</b>

09:19.530 --> 09:22.950
<b>she can open up to like family,
that they were.</b>

09:23.540 --> 09:27.330
<b>If someone needs a reason
for each and every act,</b>

09:27.330 --> 09:29.920
<b>that reason is enough for me,
that it is.</b>

09:33.590 --> 09:35.590
<b>Kenshin, I'll go with you!</b>

09:35.840 --> 09:39.430
<b>Hold it, Yahiko! Even if you go,
you'll just get in the way!</b>

09:39.430 --> 09:43.430
<b>Shut up!
That woman saved my life once already!</b>

09:43.810 --> 09:46.190
<b>I'm gonna go help her
even if my life is at risk!</b>

09:46.190 --> 09:47.230
<b>If I can't do that,</b>

09:47.230 --> 09:49.900
<b>then what is the life-giving sword
of the Kamiya Kasshin-ryu?</b>

09:54.570 --> 09:57.320
<b><i>That kid has become
a pretty good swordsman</i></b>

09:57.320 --> 09:58.820
<b><i>in his own right before we knew it.</i></b>

09:59.570 --> 10:01.910
<b>Looks like this will take all night.</b>

10:02.160 --> 10:06.410
<b>Don't forget to have breakfast for five
and a hot morning bath ready.</b>

10:06.410 --> 10:07.500
<b>Sanosuke!</b>

10:10.540 --> 10:12.800
<b>I'm done thinking about trivial things!</b>

10:13.300 --> 10:16.880
<b>I'll be like my usual self
and go make trouble!</b>

10:18.220 --> 10:19.090
<b>All right.</b>

10:20.390 --> 10:21.140
<b>Let's go!</b>

10:22.050 --> 10:25.060
<b>RUROUNI KENSHIN</b>

10:28.980 --> 10:31.690
<b>So this is Kanryu Takeda's mansion.</b>

10:32.020 --> 10:33.400
<b>Yeah.</b>

10:33.400 --> 10:35.730
<b>So, how are we going
to take this place down?</b>

10:35.730 --> 10:38.610
<b>A surprise attack with a small army
depends on its speed.</b>

10:38.610 --> 10:39.820
<b>After the gate goes down,</b>

10:39.820 --> 10:42.490
<b>we're going to race full speed
to the entrance, that we will.</b>

10:42.490 --> 10:44.660
<b>So we're breaking through the front door.</b>

10:45.040 --> 10:46.330
<b>All right!</b>

10:46.330 --> 10:47.250
<b>Sanosuke.</b>

10:48.080 --> 10:50.370
<b>Don't you fall behind us.
Got that?</b>

10:53.540 --> 10:54.710
<b>Let's go!</b>

10:56.590 --> 10:57.420
<b>What the...</b>

11:04.180 --> 11:06.390
<b>Welcome back, Megumi.</b>

11:06.640 --> 11:09.140
<b>I always knew you would come back.</b>

11:09.640 --> 11:13.400
<b>This is the only place
you can return to, after all.</b>

11:13.610 --> 11:17.360
<b>I hate to cut to the chase, but my supply
of Spiderweb is running low.</b>

11:17.820 --> 11:19.700
<b>You will make some for me, yes?</b>

11:22.870 --> 11:24.330
<b>This is a problem.</b>

11:24.830 --> 11:27.490
<b>You are always so rebellious.</b>

11:27.750 --> 11:31.210
<b>Though I really do cherish you.</b>

11:31.420 --> 11:35.590
<b>What you cherish is the profit
the opium I make creates, no?</b>

11:36.090 --> 11:36.960
<b>Yes.</b>

11:37.460 --> 11:41.300
<b>And I am making an effort
to cherish you as an afterthought.</b>

11:41.800 --> 11:43.050
<b>I see.</b>

11:43.050 --> 11:46.970
<b>Unfortunately for you,
I'm not here to make any opium.</b>

11:47.470 --> 11:48.310
<b>Huh?</b>

11:48.640 --> 11:49.810
<b>Kanryu Takeda...</b>

11:50.600 --> 11:51.560
<b>I'm here to kill you!</b>

11:53.270 --> 11:57.070
<b>Don't worry. We share the same fate.</b>

11:57.070 --> 11:59.070
<b>I will die soon enough as well.</b>

12:00.650 --> 12:03.740
<b>I have no intent of gaining
any more sins in this life.</b>

12:04.160 --> 12:06.280
<b>We're going to hell together.</b>

12:06.780 --> 12:11.080
<b>That's the least I can do to atone
for causing people agony with opium.</b>

12:16.500 --> 12:17.340
<b>My dagger...</b>

12:18.420 --> 12:19.800
<b>That's enough.</b>

12:24.760 --> 12:28.140
<b>D-D-Damn wench!</b>

12:30.520 --> 12:34.100
<b>I screwed up and pushed too hard
with the last doctor!</b>

12:34.100 --> 12:37.940
<b>So I was nice to you,
and you let it get to your head!</b>

12:38.480 --> 12:41.190
<b>Don't you dare mock me, Kanryu!</b>

12:45.570 --> 12:46.990
<b>Call for my private army!</b>

12:46.990 --> 12:49.790
<b>I'll torture her
and make her spill the refinement process!</b>

12:50.160 --> 12:52.450
<b>Everyone but the pages is all outside.</b>

12:52.450 --> 12:53.290
<b>What?</b>

12:53.790 --> 12:55.370
<b>Listen closely.</b>

12:56.710 --> 12:59.130
<b>This is... the emergency whistle!</b>

12:59.750 --> 13:02.170
<b>That man is here!</b>

13:09.050 --> 13:11.600
<b>S-So fast. What the hell was that?</b>

13:11.600 --> 13:12.600
<b>Is he human?</b>

13:12.600 --> 13:14.060
<b>Hey, hey, hey, hey!</b>

13:14.390 --> 13:15.640
<b>If you're distracted...</b>

13:15.810 --> 13:17.230
<b>you'll get hurt!</b>

13:22.360 --> 13:23.320
<b>Sanosuke!</b>

13:24.280 --> 13:25.740
<b>Don't fall behind!</b>

13:26.200 --> 13:28.700
<b>You're still at it, you brat?</b>

13:29.280 --> 13:32.870
<b>S-So strong. These two are too strong!</b>

13:33.080 --> 13:35.080
<b>You mean "these three," idiot!</b>

13:37.330 --> 13:40.040
<b>We got rid of basically
all the yakuza and swordsmen—</b>

13:42.000 --> 13:44.630
<b>Gunmen squad! Ready, aim...</b>

13:44.630 --> 13:45.550
<b>fi—</b>

13:49.390 --> 13:50.760
<b>Now! Fire!</b>

13:51.060 --> 13:52.060
<b>Sano! Yahiko!</b>

13:52.060 --> 13:52.930
<b>Yahiko!</b>

13:52.930 --> 13:53.770
<b>Sure! Huh?</b>

13:53.970 --> 13:57.730
<b>Your time to shine.
Go make good use of yourself!</b>

13:58.150 --> 13:58.980
<b>Wha—</b>

14:00.150 --> 14:01.520
<b>You brat!</b>

14:01.520 --> 14:02.780
<b>Huh?</b>

14:03.030 --> 14:05.530
<b>You looking for this, old man?</b>

14:06.700 --> 14:09.570
<b>I didn't think my talent as a pickpocket
would be useful here.</b>

14:09.570 --> 14:12.870
<b>You really don't know
what's going to happen in life.</b>

14:13.910 --> 14:14.750
<b>Bang!</b>

14:17.290 --> 14:20.420
<b>Idiot. There's no way I'd really shoot.</b>

14:20.420 --> 14:24.670
<b>I'm a swordsman!
I don't rely on things like guns!</b>

14:24.960 --> 14:25.970
<b>You little brat!</b>

14:25.970 --> 14:27.130
<b>Don't get so cocky!</b>

14:30.550 --> 14:32.470
<b>Are you all right, Yahiko, that you are?</b>

14:32.680 --> 14:34.680
<b>Of course I'm all right!</b>

14:34.680 --> 14:37.730
<b>You can't tell me to leave this late
in the game! I ain't goin' home!</b>

14:38.140 --> 14:39.900
<b>All right, that's the spirit.</b>

14:39.900 --> 14:42.110
<b>Don't you be fallin' behind, Yahiko.</b>

14:42.110 --> 14:43.320
<b>Idiot!</b>

14:43.520 --> 14:47.610
<b>For starters, how dare you throw someone
like some inanimate object?</b>

14:47.610 --> 14:49.610
<b>I made sure you had your turn.</b>

14:49.610 --> 14:51.660
<b>You should appreciate and admire me.</b>

14:51.660 --> 14:53.620
<b>I don't get it.</b>

14:53.620 --> 14:55.120
<b>Why is it?</b>

14:55.120 --> 14:58.370
<b>For what reason does Himura Battosai—</b>

14:58.500 --> 15:02.790
<b>How does it benefit him
to go this far for that woman?</b>

15:03.170 --> 15:07.260
<b>If Hitokiri Battosai was a man
who weighed the pros and cons,</b>

15:07.260 --> 15:10.130
<b>he would be a high-ranking officer
of the Ground Troops by now.</b>

15:11.680 --> 15:14.100
<b>You surely cannot understand
as an entrepreneur.</b>

15:14.600 --> 15:18.600
<b>But Imperialists, though they differ
in where they stand from us,</b>

15:18.600 --> 15:20.810
<b>all died fighting for their ideals.</b>

15:21.310 --> 15:23.060
<b>That's what they were like.</b>

15:23.610 --> 15:28.690
<b>In these days of Meiji, many Imperialists
have rotted beyond recognition.</b>

15:29.610 --> 15:32.360
<b>But that man
seems to have quite a lot of vigor.</b>

15:32.870 --> 15:36.950
<b>The first Imperialist in ten years
to show himself, lured by the bait.</b>

15:37.830 --> 15:42.370
<b>That man is the prey of us,
the Edo Castle Oniwaban Group!</b>

15:43.080 --> 15:45.170
<b>Y-You've got to be kidding!</b>

15:45.170 --> 15:47.500
<b>Turning that legendary manslayer
into an enemy?</b>

15:47.500 --> 15:49.090
<b>I can't do such a dangerous thing!</b>

15:49.300 --> 15:50.510
<b>Don't say that.</b>

15:51.090 --> 15:53.180
<b>We want to fight.</b>

15:57.680 --> 16:00.430
<b>Kanryu! Your time of reckoning has come!</b>

16:00.730 --> 16:02.650
<b>Come on down,
and bring Miss Megumi with you!</b>

16:08.860 --> 16:09.740
<b>What the...</b>

16:10.320 --> 16:11.950
<b>Has he finally gone mad?</b>

16:14.110 --> 16:15.780
<b>Wonderful!</b>

16:15.780 --> 16:19.750
<b>He defeated over 50 of my private army
in a breathtaking instant!</b>

16:19.750 --> 16:23.620
<b>I expected nothing less from
the legendary manslayer, Himura Battosai!</b>

16:24.040 --> 16:26.170
<b>He knows about Kenshin's background.</b>

16:26.670 --> 16:28.960
<b>Looks like the Oniwaban Group
did their research.</b>

16:29.170 --> 16:32.380
<b>Splendid! I would truly be
the most powerful around</b>

16:32.380 --> 16:35.930
<b>if you joined my ranks
along with the Oniwaban Group!</b>

16:36.140 --> 16:39.390
<b>I will pay a sum
equal to 50 of my private army!</b>

16:39.390 --> 16:42.390
<b>How about it?
Why won't you become my bodyguard?</b>

16:42.560 --> 16:45.900
<b>Are you coming down or not? Which is it?</b>

16:46.900 --> 16:49.070
<b>Th-Then 100 men's worth!</b>

16:50.570 --> 16:52.240
<b>T-Two hundred!</b>

16:52.240 --> 16:53.820
<b>You don't get it.</b>

16:54.820 --> 16:58.120
<b>It's useless
trying to win him over with money.</b>

16:58.120 --> 17:01.750
<b>I told you that Himura Battosai
wasn't a man who weighed the benefits.</b>

17:03.750 --> 17:04.960
<b><i>All right.</i></b>

17:05.210 --> 17:08.790
<b>I get it. I lose. I surrender.</b>

17:08.790 --> 17:10.670
<b>I will let go of Megumi Takani!</b>

17:10.920 --> 17:12.880
<b>But give me some time. One hour!</b>

17:13.420 --> 17:16.470
<b>I need to prepare on my end as well!
Please!</b>

17:16.800 --> 17:18.760
<b>I ask you to calmly pull back for now!</b>

17:18.760 --> 17:21.390
<b>Like we can trust you saying that, putz!</b>

17:26.230 --> 17:28.060
<b>Kenshin! Hold on!</b>

17:28.060 --> 17:30.650
<b>There's a limit on how much
of a softie you can be! Come on!</b>

17:30.820 --> 17:34.070
<b><i>All right! I will use this hour
to torture her,</i></b>

17:34.070 --> 17:36.410
<b><i>and if I can get her to spill
how to refine Spiderweb,</i></b>

17:36.410 --> 17:38.370
<b><i>I will no longer have a need for Megumi!</i></b>

17:38.370 --> 17:40.410
<b>I can do whatever I please
to shut her mouth!</b>

18:02.390 --> 18:04.850
<b>I will be there within the hour!</b>

18:04.850 --> 18:06.890
<b>Brace yourself as you wait, Kanryu!</b>

18:09.310 --> 18:11.900
<b>Makeshift ploys
just add fuel to the fire.</b>

18:12.400 --> 18:15.320
<b>I see.
He has quite an explosive personality.</b>

18:15.320 --> 18:18.740
<b>L-Leader, set up the Oniwaban Group!</b>

18:18.740 --> 18:20.030
<b>Already done.</b>

18:21.330 --> 18:25.870
<b>The large hallway leading to the entrance
and the staircase at the end of it,</b>

18:25.870 --> 18:28.290
<b>I have stationed
my right-hand and left-hand men.</b>

18:29.040 --> 18:32.250
<b>I will serve as the rear guard
in the ballroom that lies beyond.</b>

18:32.590 --> 18:37.420
<b>Listen up. I don't want any more
useless scum like Beshimi or Hyottoko!</b>

18:37.420 --> 18:42.600
<b>I will not allow anyone to slack off and
not do work befitting their high salaries!</b>

18:44.100 --> 18:47.730
<b>What was that about, "I will not allow"?</b>

18:48.980 --> 18:50.440
<b>Don't get the wrong idea.</b>

18:51.270 --> 18:53.980
<b>You don't lead the Oniwaban Group.</b>

18:54.650 --> 18:56.490
<b>The Oniwaban Group is my group.</b>

18:57.190 --> 18:59.700
<b>I will not allow anyone to insult it.</b>

19:03.990 --> 19:06.200
<b>They're after Megumi Takani.</b>

19:07.120 --> 19:10.330
<b>I will lock her up
in the third-floor observatory.</b>

19:10.960 --> 19:13.540
<b>You shouldn't butt in
where you're not wanted.</b>

19:13.540 --> 19:15.800
<b>Sit here, and count money or something.</b>

19:29.770 --> 19:30.730
<b>You're awake.</b>

19:31.730 --> 19:34.190
<b>Is this... the observatory?</b>

19:34.190 --> 19:35.730
<b>How did I—</b>

19:35.730 --> 19:39.860
<b>The men of the Kamiya Dojo are attacking
in an effort to win you back.</b>

19:40.110 --> 19:41.070
<b>Lies.</b>

19:41.070 --> 19:42.620
<b>What good does lying do?</b>

19:43.120 --> 19:45.740
<b>For instance, the private army
has already been annihilated.</b>

19:47.370 --> 19:48.330
<b>Idiots.</b>

19:48.540 --> 19:52.750
<b>I took the effort to back away
from all of them, so why...</b>

19:53.540 --> 19:58.340
<b>why are the people there idiots,
each and every one of them?</b>

20:00.760 --> 20:02.470
<b>This is your dagger.</b>

20:02.470 --> 20:03.720
<b>I'll return it to you.</b>

20:04.390 --> 20:06.640
<b>Don't haphazardly have hope.</b>

20:07.140 --> 20:09.480
<b>They will never make it here.</b>

20:10.180 --> 20:15.020
<b>In one hour, what awaits you is
not salvation, but Kanryu's torture.</b>

20:15.230 --> 20:21.450
<b>An agonizing death or a peaceful one,
you can choose the one you wish for.</b>

20:22.360 --> 20:26.870
<b>We don't care about the opium
or the money that Kanryu desires.</b>

20:27.870 --> 20:31.710
<b>We, the Oniwaban Group,
are seeking battles.</b>

20:32.250 --> 20:36.460
<b>I came here thinking things might get
suspicious with illicit sales of opium,</b>

20:36.460 --> 20:39.420
<b>but thanks to you I have
come across a most supreme enemy.</b>

20:39.630 --> 20:40.970
<b>This is thanks for that.</b>

20:42.380 --> 20:46.140
<b>I have some sympathy
for your unfortunate life.</b>

20:46.350 --> 20:49.390
<b>But even that doesn't matter anymore.</b>

20:58.270 --> 21:00.030
<b>This is surprising, that it is.</b>

21:00.820 --> 21:03.740
<b>A man who is as skilled as you
is up first, that you are?</b>

21:04.110 --> 21:06.120
<b>That's why I told you...</b>

21:06.120 --> 21:10.200
<b>that there's no need to fret
and we will fight at some point.</b>

22:45.090 --> 22:50.090
<b>NEXT EPISODE
SAVAGE HAN'NYA -
HONORABLE SHIKIJO</b>

22:46.090 --> 22:49.590
<b><i>Next episode,
"Savage Han'nya, Honorable Shikijo."</i></b>
